id: CTB-SRC0013-7-3
source: SRC-0013
section: §7.3
kind: requirement
extends: LXM-REQ-000108
text: Final acceptance principle: LUXORA is a universal multi-business platform whose supported business models can be configured from shared, implemented and discoverable capabilities. The first production deployment is an Amazon-like marketplace, while the platform is built from the outset to configure and extend additional business models and industries through the same governed mechanisms.
